              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Devid gwakwara nwa ya Solomọn okwu sị, \"Dị ike, nwee obi ike, rụọ ọrụ a. Atụla ụjọ, adakwala mba, nʼihi na",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.28.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineke, bụ Chineke m, nọnyeere gị. Ọ gaghị ahapụ gị, maọbụ gbakụta gị azụ. Ọ ga-ahụ na ihe niile gaara gị nke ọma, tutu ruo mgbe ọrụ iwu ụlọnsọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
